From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 15:32:28 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat(kanban):=20condition=20wakes=20=E2=80=94?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20scheduled=20cards=20wake=20when=20a=20wake=5Fcheck=20probe?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20passes=20[daveey]?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Parks (kanban_schedule, kanban_block kind=time, kanban_continue wait, CLI
schedule/block) accept wake_check/check_every/clock_only. The dispatcher probes
due checks off-thread (bash -lc, 30 s timeout, <=4 at once, never blocks the
tick); exit 0 wakes with condition_met, 3 broken runs wake with
wake_check_broken. Parks >2 h out with no probe are refused unless clock_only.
State in task_wake_checks; shown in kanban show, worker context, board API;
diagnostics flag clock_only_park, wake_check_failing, wake_check_overdue.

Public-series adaptation: preserve merged preceding changes.

---
